lg-magic (1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: DKMS kernel module + lg-magic userspace tools.
    - C port of the Python tools as a single multi-call binary (no
      Python runtime dependencies)
    - lg-magic setup: interactive configuration and calibration wizard
    - udev rules for the IMU evdev device, hidraw and uinput

